# Mannerly — environment
#
# Put your REAL Supabase values in a file named `.env` (NOT here).
#   .env          → git-ignored, read by Vite. Your keys go here.
#   .env.example  → committed template. Keep it blank.
#
# Quick start:  cp .env.example .env   then fill in the two lines below in .env
#
# Values live in your Supabase project under Settings → API. The anon/public
# key is a client key (it ships in the app) — Row Level Security protects data.
# Never put the service_role / secret key in the app.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
